  "categorias": "Deportes|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p>El pabell&oacute;n vila d&#39;Onda acogi&oacute; durante la tarde de ayer s&aacute;bado el I open de razilian Jiu Jitsu y Grappling, en el que participaron algo m&aacute;s de 90 luchadores pdertenecientes a 18 clubs de Catalunya, Euskadi, Andaluc&iacute;a y la Comunitat Valenciana.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2012/04/IMG_5109.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>La prueba estaba organizada por el gimansio Kubotan de Onda , cuyo club de lucha obtiene excelentes resultados en Espa&ntilde;a y en Europa, principalmente con Juan Garc&iacute;a Garrido, Esther Gil Robles y Nazar Vintonyak.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/openjiujitsu/img_5108.jpg\" alt=\"img_5108\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/openjiujitsu/img_5109.jpg\" alt=\"img_5109\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/openjiujitsu/img_5110.jpg\" alt=\"img_5110\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/openjiujitsu/img_5111.jpg\" alt=\"img_5111\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/openjiujitsu/img_5112.jpg\" alt=\"img_5112\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/openjiujitsu/img_5113.jpg\" alt=\"img_5113\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/openjiujitsu/img_5114.jpg\" alt=\"img_5114\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/openjiujitsu/img_5115.jpg\" alt=\"img_5115\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4